and increases Normal Attack and Skill damage based on Elemental Mastery."},{"name":"Uraku Misugiri","text":"Provides CRIT DMG and boosts Normal Attack and Elemental Skill. Especially strong with a Geo teammate."},{"name":"Primordial Jade Cutter","text":"Excellent CRIT Rate and a consistent ATK bonus; especially competitive in multi-target fights."},{"name":"Haran Geppaku Futsu","text":"CRIT Rate and Normal Attack bonuses; best when Alhaitham uses more Normal Attacks in his combos."},{"name":"Freedom-Sworn","text":"EM and a situational team buff. Its support passive can be awkward to activate on Alhaitham. Only when passive activation is reliable."},{"name":"Toukabou Shigure","text":"Event EM sword with strong single-target damage against a marked enemy. Primarily single-target."},{"name":"Wolf-Fang","text":"CRIT Rate and Skill damage strengthen his Projection Attacks. Especially valuable at high refinements. Higher refinements help."},{"name":"Summit Shaper","text":"ATK-based stat stick; its passive is more useful when protected by a shield. Prefer a shield."}],"a":[{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Boosts Elemental Mastery and ATK, strengthening his Spread damage.","stats":"EM · Dendro DMG · CR/CD"},{"names":["Deepwood Memories"],"text":"Reduces enemy Dendro RES, boosting Alhaitham's personal and team damage.","stats":"EM · Dendro DMG · CR/CD"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams","Wanderer's Troupe"],"text":"Combines 160 Elemental Mastery, boosting Spread damage and overall output.","stats":"EM · Dendro DMG · CR/CD"}],"t":[{"name":"Spread Kings","members":["Alhaitham","Nahida","Yae Miko","Zhongli"],"text":"Alhaitham drives Spread damage while Nahida buffs EM, Yae adds Electro, and Zhongli shreds resistance.","roles":["On-field DPS","Dendro Enabler / Buffer","Off-field DPS","Shielder / Debuffer"]},{"name":"Lunar Bloom","members":["Alhaitham","Lauma","Furina","Kuki Shinobu"],"text":"Alhaitham drives Dendro damage, Lauma buffs Bloom, Furina boosts damage, and Kuki triggers Hyp